{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And you shall transfer every firstborn of the womb.</b> As in והעברתם את נחלתו לבתו — they transfer the inheritance from the male relatives to the daughter; so too here, you transfer the firstborn from the status of the other sons to give him to HaShem." "<b>And every firstborn of animal offspring.</b> Israel had no unclean animals at that time except the donkey; therefore there was no need to specify 'clean.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:57:35.290072542Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}